<title>USA: Pomeroy Computer Q4 revs increase.</title>
<headline>Pomeroy Computer Q4 revs increase.</headline>
<dateline>HEBRON, Ky. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pomeroy Computer  Resources said Tuesday for the quarter ended Jan 5, gross  revenues increased about 72.0 percent to $102 million from  $59.3 million for the prior comparable quarter.  For the year, gross revenues increased about 45.0 percent to $335 million from $231 million for the prior year.</p>
<p>The  company expects to release  earnings for fiscal 1996 by mid-February.</p>
<p>The  company also reported the planned opening of four new  regional facilities:  Columbus, Ohio; Memphis, Tenn.; Montgomery,  Ala.; and Tampa, Fla.</p>
</text>
